{"path":"string/basic_string/copy","title":"std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::copy","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;::</span>copy","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string/copy","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Copies a substring [pos, pos + count) to character string pointed to by dest. If the requested substring lasts past the end of the string, or if count == npos, the copied substring is [pos, size()).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size_type copy<span class=\"br0\">(</span> CharT<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> dest, size_type count, size_type pos <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Copies a substring <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> count</span></code><code>)</code></span> to character string pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">dest</span></code>. If the requested substring lasts past the end of the string, or if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> npos</span></code>, the copied substring is <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/size\"><code>size()</code></a><code>)</code></span>.\n</p><p>The resulting character string is not null-terminated.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> dest\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the destination character string\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> count\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> length of the substring\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> pos\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> position of the first character to include\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Number of characters copied.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/out_of_range\">std::out_of_range</a></span> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>If an exception is thrown for any reason, this function has no effect (<a href=\"/w/cpp/language/exceptions#Exception_safety\">strong exception safety guarantee</a>).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Linear in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> foo<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"WINE\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// brace-initialization initializes all characters to 0,</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// providing a null-terminator</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> bar<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// do not copy the last char, to guarantee null-termination</span>\n    foo.<span class=\"me1\">copy</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>bar, sizeof bar <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> bar <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// requires bar to be null-terminated</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>WIN</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue847\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 847</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>there was no exception safety guarantee\n</td>\n<td>added strong exception safety guarantee\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/substr\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>substr</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a substring <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view/copy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>copy</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies characters <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_string_view&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/copy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>copy</span><span>copy_if</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies a range of elements to a new location <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/memcpy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>memcpy</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  copies one buffer to another <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/basic_string","title":"std::basic_string"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::copy","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Copies a substring [pos, pos + count) to character string pointed to by dest."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"dest, count, pos"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Number of characters copied."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"std::out_of_range if pos > size()."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Linear in count."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"substr","note":"returns a substring"},{"label":"copy","note":"copies characters"},{"label":"copy, copy_if","note":"copies a range of elements to a new location"},{"label":"memcpy","note":"copies one buffer to another"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":240,"codeBlockCount":2}
